---
// Post 12 (Backtest) figure: BestOfN. Inline SVG, site tokens only, no ids. Numbers come from the Python runs recorded in the post brief.
---
<figure class="atp12-bestofn">
  <div class="atp12-bestofn-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 362" role="img" aria-label="A chart of the best in-sample Sharpe ratio among N strategies that are pure noise. It rises from about 0 at N equal 1 to 0.69 at 10, 1.00 at 50, 1.12 at 100 and 1.37 at 500, while the same chosen strategy&#x27;s Sharpe ratio in the following year stays near zero.">
<text x="20" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Pick the best of N strategies that are all pure noise</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chọn cái tốt nhất trong N chiến lược toàn là nhiễu</tspan></text>
<line x1="100" y1="273.3333333333333" x2="820" y2="273.3333333333333" class="ax" />
<text x="90" y="277.3333333333333" text-anchor="end" class="s">0.0</text>
<line x1="100" y1="206.66666666666669" x2="820" y2="206.66666666666669" class="grid" />
<text x="90" y="210.66666666666669" text-anchor="end" class="s">0.5</text>
<line x1="100" y1="140.0" x2="820" y2="140.0" class="grid" />
<text x="90" y="144.0" text-anchor="end" class="s">1.0</text>
<line x1="100" y1="73.33333333333334" x2="820" y2="73.33333333333334" class="grid" />
<text x="90" y="77.33333333333334" text-anchor="end" class="s">1.5</text>
<text x="20" y="55.33333333333334" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>Sharpe</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Sharpe</tspan></text>
<polyline points="100.0,273.9 359.4,181.3 540.6,140.3 618.7,123.6 800.0,91.2" class="redl" />
<polyline points="100.0,271.1 359.4,274.3 540.6,272.7 618.7,266.7 800.0,267.6" class="goldl" />
<circle cx="100.0" cy="273.3" r="7" class="hole" /><circle cx="100.0" cy="273.9" r="4.5" class="redf" /><circle cx="100.0" cy="271.1" r="4.5" class="goldf" />
<text x="100.0" y="259.9" text-anchor="middle" class="t13 redt">0.00</text>
<text x="100.0" y="293.1" text-anchor="middle" class="t13 goldt">0.02</text>
<text x="100.0" y="324" text-anchor="middle" class="s">1</text>
<circle cx="359.4" cy="179.5" r="7" class="hole" /><circle cx="359.4" cy="181.3" r="4.5" class="redf" /><circle cx="359.4" cy="274.3" r="4.5" class="goldf" />
<text x="359.4" y="167.3" text-anchor="middle" class="t13 redt">0.69</text>
<text x="359.4" y="296.3" text-anchor="middle" class="t13 goldt">-0.01</text>
<text x="359.4" y="324" text-anchor="middle" class="s">10</text>
<circle cx="540.6" cy="137.6" r="7" class="hole" /><circle cx="540.6" cy="140.3" r="4.5" class="redf" /><circle cx="540.6" cy="272.7" r="4.5" class="goldf" />
<text x="540.6" y="126.3" text-anchor="middle" class="t13 redt">1.00</text>
<text x="540.6" y="294.7" text-anchor="middle" class="t13 goldt">0.01</text>
<text x="540.6" y="324" text-anchor="middle" class="s">50</text>
<circle cx="618.7" cy="122.4" r="7" class="hole" /><circle cx="618.7" cy="123.6" r="4.5" class="redf" /><circle cx="618.7" cy="266.7" r="4.5" class="goldf" />
<text x="618.7" y="109.6" text-anchor="middle" class="t13 redt">1.12</text>
<text x="618.7" y="288.7" text-anchor="middle" class="t13 goldt">0.05</text>
<text x="618.7" y="324" text-anchor="middle" class="s">100</text>
<circle cx="800.0" cy="91.3" r="7" class="hole" /><circle cx="800.0" cy="91.2" r="4.5" class="redf" /><circle cx="800.0" cy="267.6" r="4.5" class="goldf" />
<text x="800.0" y="77.2" text-anchor="middle" class="t13 redt">1.37</text>
<text x="800.0" y="289.6" text-anchor="middle" class="t13 goldt">0.04</text>
<text x="800.0" y="324" text-anchor="middle" class="s">500</text>
<text x="460" y="346" class="s" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Strategies tried, N (log scale)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Số chiến lược đã thử, N (thang log)</tspan></text>
<circle cx="140" cy="52" r="4.5" class="redf" /><text x="152" y="56" class="t13"><tspan data-lang-en>best in-sample Sharpe</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Sharpe tốt nhất trong mẫu</tspan></text>
<circle cx="140" cy="74" r="4.5" class="goldf" /><text x="152" y="78" class="t13"><tspan data-lang-en>same strategy, next year</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cùng chiến lược, năm kế tiếp</tspan></text>
<circle cx="140" cy="96" r="7" class="hole" /><text x="152" y="100" class="t13"><tspan data-lang-en>formula for the expected best</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>công thức cho giá trị tốt nhất kỳ vọng</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Simulated data: each strategy is 1,260 days of random returns (5 years), judged on those days, then followed for 252 more. Averages of 2,000 repeats; hollow rings are the deflated-Sharpe formula.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Số liệu mô phỏng: mỗi chiến lược là 1.260 ngày lợi suất ngẫu nhiên (5 năm), chấm trên những ngày đó rồi theo dõi thêm 252 ngày. Trung bình của 2.000 lần lặp; vòng rỗng là công thức deflated Sharpe.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .atp12-bestofn { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .atp12-bestofn-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .atp12-bestofn svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .atp12-bestofn text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .atp12-bestofn .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp12-bestofn .s { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp12-bestofn .t13 { font-size: 13px; }
  .atp12-bestofn .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp12-bestofn .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp12-bestofn .goldt { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp12-bestofn .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); }
  .atp12-bestofn .okb { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); }
  .atp12-bestofn .badb { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .atp12-bestofn .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .atp12-bestofn .arrf { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp12-bestofn .ax { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; fill: none; }
  .atp12-bestofn .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; fill: none; }
  .atp12-bestofn .redl { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp12-bestofn .goldl { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp12-bestofn .mutl { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .atp12-bestofn .redf { fill: var(--red); }
  .atp12-bestofn .goldf { fill: var(--gold); }
  .atp12-bestofn .mutf { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .atp12-bestofn .hole { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp12-bestofn figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
